                                "sense_id": "76ebcea1-97cf-3939-8707-dbaba523c7ed",
                                "text": "Not only did it give the Russians an abiding fear of encirclement, whether by nomadic hordes or by nuclear-missile sites, but it also launched them on their relentless drive eastwards and southwards into Asia, and eventually collision with the British in India."
